WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.333
SEO is not about tricking Google.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Most people think SEO means stuffing keywords into your website.

3
00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:19.333
That approach worked in 2005. Now it will hurt your rankings.

4
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:24.667
SEO = making content genuinely useful for search engines.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.667
How Google works: search query → crawl billions → pick most relevant.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.333
Three pillars: Content, Authority, Technical.

7
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:52.667
Content = actually answers the question better than everyone else.

8
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:58.667
The top Google result gets 30% of all clicks.

9
00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:04.667
SEO compounds. Unlike ads — it keeps working after you stop paying.

10
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.667
Learn digital marketing at 0xverse Academy.

